# What a build of the image does not need from the checkout: what an earlier build or run left behind,
# the history, the tests, which the image does not compile, the documentation, and editors' and tools'
# own folders. A smaller context is sent faster, and a change to a test or to the documentation does
# not make Docker compile RESTest again. README.md stays: a release carries it.
**/target
**/restest-out
**/*.sqlite
**/src/test
*.md
!README.md
*.png
.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.vscode
docs
